{"id":"vod_md_5852","vodId":"5852","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"DARLING in the FRANXX","name_cn":"DARLING in the FRANXX","date":"2018-01-01","year":"2018","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"24集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20231011-1/9a4bca0c9087d77c7f1055418415a109.jpg"},"summary":"他们拥有梦想。总有一天，飞向广阔天空的梦想。知晓被玻璃遮盖的这片天空有多么遥远。遥远的未来。人类在荒废的大地上建设了移动要塞都市“种植园”，并讴歌着文明。在那当中建造的驾驶员居住设施“米斯特汀”，通称“鸟笼”。孩子们就住在那里。对外面的世界一无所知。对自由的天空一无所知。他们被告知的使命，只有战斗而已。敌人是一切都被谜团覆盖的巨大生命体“叫龙”。为了对抗尚未见过的敌人，孩子们乘上被称为“FRANXX”的机器人。他们坚信，乘坐其中，就是对自己存在的证明。有一位曾被称作神童的少年。代号016。名字是广。但他现在却跌落谷底。是不被人需要的存在。如果没有乘上FRANXX，就如同不存在一样。在这样的广面前，某天，一位被称作02的神秘少女出现了。她的额头，长着两根艳丽的角。“——找到了哦，我的DARLING”","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-10-11 07:55:55","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231010/BV9HmBh2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231010/XntkOOC8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231010/vewe2Rg0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231010/WQIOhjPQ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231010/U28xo4fm/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231010/c5zpXRuT/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231010/udqrOUIe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231010/Q0lPogMF/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231010/rPxWonVA/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231010/l0LMJ6I5/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231010/ixV0gne4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231010/KQ2LElRJ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231010/9p4qySyU/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231010/beOFmuId/in